ibility and competitiveness. [Depop fees](https://depophelp.zendesk.com/hc/en-gb/articles/360001791127-Seller-fees-and-charges), [search-ranking factors](https://depophelp.zendesk.com/hc/en-gb/articles/9422984899985-How-Depop-ranks-search-results-and-recommends-listings)\r\n========================================\r\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
